      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Expense Model (manual method)\n1) adding an expense\n2) Editing an expense\n3) Deleting an expense \n\n\nIn each api of the expense model \n1) we will update the money spent\n \n 2)  check that wheather the month has been changed or not , if\nchanged then update the budget to zero and also update the current\nmonth and year \n\n3) Check if budget have exceeded the 100% or 80% or 60% mark and\nsend notification according to it",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "Df_HfdlCbwIce60aYhsRh",
      "originalText": "Expense Model (manual method)\n1) adding an expense\n2) Editing an expense\n3) Deleting an expense \n\n\nIn each api of the expense model \n1) we will update the money spent\n \n 2)  check that wheather the month has been changed or not , if changed then update the budget to zero and also update the current month and year \n\n3) Check if budget have exceeded the 100% or 80% or 60% mark and send notification according to it",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
