      "text": "100 ka budget \n20kharch \n80 bacha hua hai\n\nnow 40 kharch hua to ab  80-40 = 40 bacha hai \n\nab, ye 60% used to phir 60 ka notification chla jaega \n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n80 kharch ho gya tb?\n80>= 100 false \n80>=80 true so notification dedo and krdo",
